{"speciesId":693,"names":{"fr":"Gamblast","es":"Clawitzer","en":"Clawitzer","ja":"ブロスター"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son énorme pince projette de véritables obus d’eau capables de transpercer la coque d’un pétrolier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Posee una enorme pinza que dispara bolas de agua que podrían atravesar incluso el casco de un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their enormous claws launch cannonballs of water powerful enough to pierce tanker hulls."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"水の 砲弾を 発射する 巨大な 腕を 持つ。 タンカーの 船体を 撃ち抜くぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La force de propulsion générée par l’expulsion de l’eau via la tuyère située à l’arrière de sa pince peut lui conférer une vitesse de 60 nœuds."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El chorro de agua que dispara la tobera situada en la parte trasera de su pinza le permite avanzar a una velocidad de 60 nudos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"By expelling water from the nozzle in the back of its claw, it can move at a speed of 60 knots."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ハサミの 後ろの ノズルから 水を 噴き出す 推進力で ６０ノットの スピードで 進む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son énorme pince projette de véritables obus d’eau capables de transpercer la coque d’un pétrolier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Posee una enorme pinza que dispara bolas de agua que podrían atravesar incluso el casco de un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Their enormous claws launch cannonballs of water powerful enough to pierce tanker hulls."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"水の 砲弾を 発射する 巨大な 腕を 持つ。 タンカーの 船体を 撃ち抜くぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La force de propulsion générée par l’expulsion de l’eau via la tuyère située à l’arrière de sa pince peut lui conférer une vitesse de 60 nœuds."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El chorro de agua que dispara la tobera situada en la parte trasera de su pinza le permite avanzar a una velocidad de 60 nudos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"By expelling water from the nozzle in the back of its claw, it can move at a speed of 60 knots."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ハサミの 後ろの ノズルから 水を 噴き出す 推進力で ６０ノットの スピードで 進む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il aspire de l’eau et la projette sous pression pour attaquer. Le jet est si puissant qu’il perce même d’épaisses plaques d’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Comprime el agua que traga y la convierte en proyectiles de tal potencia que atraviesan incluso gruesas placas de metal."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It compresses the water it has sucked up and then projects it with enough power to punch a hole right through a thick sheet of iron."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"取り込んだ 水を 圧縮して 撃ちだす。 分厚い 鉄板に 穴を 開けるほどの 威力だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La chair de sa pince droite est très ferme. Les pinces tombées sont vendues à l’étranger comme ingrédients de cuisine."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La pinza de su extremidad derecha es muy robusta. Cuando se les caen, se recogen para exportarlas como ingrediente culinario."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its right arm is packed with meat. When its pincer falls off, it’s exported to be used as a cooking ingredient."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"右腕の 身は よく締まっている。 もげた ハサミは 食材 として 海外に 輸出 される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il projette des obus d’eau sur ses ennemis après les avoir localisés grâce aux antennes situées sur son énorme pince."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Las antenas de su enorme pinza le permiten detectar la posición de sus presas para luego acribillarlas a cañonazos con bolas de agua."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After using the feelers on its oversized claw to detect the location of prey, Clawitzer launches a cannonball of water at its target."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"巨大な ハサミの 触角で 獲物の 居場所を 感知して 水の 砲弾を 発射する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa pince droite est un canon pouvant projeter des obus d’eau assez puissants pour couler un navire-citerne."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Con el cañón de su brazo derecho dispara proyectiles de agua marina con tanta potencia que son capaces de hundir un petrolero."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Clawitzer’s right arm is a cannon that launches projectiles made of seawater. Shots from a Clawitzer’s cannon arm can sink a tanker."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"右腕は 海水の 砲弾を 発射する 大砲。 タンカーを 沈めてしまうほどの 威力だ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":693,"moves":[{"name":"vice-grip","learns":[[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"level-up",25],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",25],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",25],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",25],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",35],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",35],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"bubble-beam","learns":[[15,"lev